WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Original score: Night Dividend. Bass, drums, keys and brass.]
Crown City. Make your own heat.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Every debt has a name.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
[A launch accelerates along Crown Canal.]
Always have a second exit.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.000
MetaWin Terrace. The house keeps two sets of books.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
Gold Mage owns the night.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
[Helicopter rotors rise over the music.]
Take the high road.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
[The Skylark takes off.]
Leave the skyline behind.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Pinewatch. The city is only the beginning.

00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
Crown Transit. One last train.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.000
[Gunfire and distant sirens.]
No clean getaways.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
[The score builds as the Riot crosses the neon district.]
The house owes you.

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Crown City: After Hours. Play free in your browser.
